        "Description": "Part 2 of the BIRDNEST custom campaign.\r\rInformation obtained from The Grouse&apos;s tablet links her to an international drug cartel known as Birdnest. The ICA hasn’t taken a stance on what to do about Birdnest, and won’t until more is known about the cartel. In the meantime, 47 has been tasked with eliminating Rolf Hirschmüller and Michail Nenkov, two  of The Grouse’s former business partners presently located in the Berlin-based Club Hölle.",
